ns. Brands requiring premium cinematography, extensive B-roll, or animation may invest CHF 20,000–50,000+. Work with a producer upfront to align budget with goals.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do product videos help with Google rankings?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Videos on landing pages increase dwell time and reduce bounce rates, both SEO ranking factors. Optimised video titles, descriptions, and schema markup signal relevance to Google. Videos also generate backlinks and social shares, boosting domain authority. Expect improved rankings within 3–6 months of publishing.\"}}]}]}"}></script>
